Topic 07 – Pattern Programs
Objective: Nested loops, row/column logic, counters and pattern construction.
No.	Program	Requirement
01	Right-Angled Star Pattern	Print a right-angled triangle using stars.
02	Inverted Star Triangle	Print an inverted right-angled triangle.
03	Square Star Pattern	Print a square pattern of stars using nested loops.
04	Number Triangle	Print a triangle where each row contains numbers from 1 up to the row number.
05	Repeated Number Triangle	Print a triangle where each row contains the same number.
06	Inverted Number Triangle	Print an inverted number triangle.
07	Pyramid Pattern	Print a centered pyramid using spaces and stars.
08	Inverted Pyramid	Print an inverted centered pyramid.
09	Diamond Pattern	Print a full diamond pattern using stars.
10	Floyd's Triangle	Print sequential numbers in a triangular pattern.

